  "verbalization": "Tomentosanol D appears to interact with CCF-STTG1 through a series of molecular pathways, with the most direct link being its targeting of MOVP-3, which in turn is targeted by Npc15336. This suggests a potential role for Tomentosanol D in modulating the activity of Npc15336, which ultimately influences CCF-STTG1. The evidence is supported by multiple paths, all pointing to a chain of targets that culminate in CCF-STTG1. The mechanism involves a series of kinase-like interactions, with Tomentosanol D acting as a modulator of a downstream signaling cascade. The integration of these pathways highlights a possible regulatory role for Tomentosanol D in the activation or inhibition of CCF-STTG1, though the exact nature of the interaction remains to be fully elucidated.",
